WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.968 --> 00:00:02.033
-Well, guys, it seems like

00:00:02.033 --> 00:00:03.400
there's so much
going on right now.

00:00:03.400 --> 00:00:04.434
Last night, President Biden

00:00:04.434 --> 00:00:05.801
delivered the
State of the Union,

00:00:05.801 --> 00:00:07.834
this Sunday is the Super Bowl,

00:00:07.834 --> 00:00:10.534
Valentine's Day
is next week -- yeah --

00:00:10.534 --> 00:00:13.033
and Taco Bell just announced
a new Mexican pizza

00:00:13.033 --> 00:00:16.501
that's four times bigger, called
the Big Ass Mexican Pizza.

00:00:16.501 --> 00:00:18.501
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:20.667 --> 00:00:22.000
There's a lot to go over,

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:23.734
so let's just jump in
and cover it all at once.

00:00:23.734 --> 00:00:25.234
It's time for a "News Smash."

00:00:25.234 --> 00:00:27.234
[ Cheers and applause ]
♪♪

00:00:30.667 --> 00:00:33.200
First up, last night's
State of the Union address.

00:00:33.200 --> 00:00:35.901
Biden spoke to the nation about
his goals and achievements.

00:00:35.901 --> 00:00:37.567
For Washington,
the State of the Union

00:00:37.567 --> 00:00:39.100
is basically their version of...

00:00:39.100 --> 00:00:40.400
the Super Bowl.

00:00:40.400 --> 00:00:43.200
We started with 32 teams.
Now we're down to the final two.

00:00:43.200 --> 00:00:45.734
Kansas City and Philadelphia
are fired up

00:00:45.734 --> 00:00:47.033
and ready to fight it out.

00:00:47.033 --> 00:00:48.934
One thing's for certain --
they're not...

00:00:48.934 --> 00:00:50.033
in love.

00:00:50.033 --> 00:00:52.601
Valentine's Day
is less than a week away.

00:00:52.601 --> 00:00:54.133
If you don't have
a reservation by now,

00:00:54.133 --> 00:00:55.801
you'll be taking your date to...

00:00:55.801 --> 00:00:56.868
Taco Bell.

00:00:56.868 --> 00:00:59.934
Now, they're offering a new item

00:00:59.934 --> 00:01:02.868
called the
Big Ass Mexican Pizza.

00:01:02.868 --> 00:01:05.667
If you eat one of those, you're
definitely going to need some...

00:01:05.667 --> 00:01:06.734
healthcare.

00:01:06.734 --> 00:01:08.801
It's one of the many things

00:01:08.801 --> 00:01:10.167
Biden talked about
in his speech.

00:01:10.167 --> 00:01:12.667
Democrats loved it,
but Republicans looked...

00:01:12.667 --> 00:01:14.767
sick to their stomachs.

00:01:14.767 --> 00:01:17.000
That grande Mexican pizza
will do that to you,

00:01:17.000 --> 00:01:18.334
but it's the perfect
thing to order

00:01:18.334 --> 00:01:19.901
after you finish smoking a...

00:01:19.901 --> 00:01:21.734
Super Bowl.

00:01:21.734 --> 00:01:25.467
Patrick Mahomes and Jalen Hurts
will be giving their all,

00:01:25.467 --> 00:01:27.133
trying their best to...

00:01:27.133 --> 00:01:29.100
score.

00:01:29.100 --> 00:01:31.434
If you go on a date,
make sure to be a good listener.

00:01:31.434 --> 00:01:32.467
Don't just...

00:01:32.467 --> 00:01:35.434
talk for an hour straight.

00:01:35.434 --> 00:01:38.067
Biden covered a lot --
jobs, the economy,

00:01:38.067 --> 00:01:39.467
and our Southern border with...

00:01:39.467 --> 00:01:41.334
Mexico.

00:01:41.334 --> 00:01:44.133
If you finish the whole pizza,
you can say goodbye to your...

00:01:44.133 --> 00:01:45.634
tight end.

00:01:45.634 --> 00:01:46.901
In conclusion...

00:01:46.901 --> 00:01:48.234
standing O's...

00:01:48.234 --> 00:01:49.634
go, team, go...

00:01:49.634 --> 00:01:51.200
accept this rose...

00:01:51.200 --> 00:01:53.033
por favor, no.

00:01:53.033 --> 00:01:55.234
This has been a "News Smash."

00:01:55.234 --> 00:01:57.234
[ Cheers and applause ]
♪♪

